        <mxCell id="c242" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;fontSize=11;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;fontColor=#000000;size=14;" value="Notes&#xa;- Solid line = identifying relation (FK is part of PK), dashed = non-identifying.&#xa;- Rounded table = dependent table (its PK includes a FK).&#xa;- UK1 = UNIQUE(course_code, version). A changed layout is a new row with a higher version.&#xa;- planned_hours is NULL for activities that have a workload_formula (Examination, Administration);&#xa;  their hours = base_hours + hours_per_hp * hp + hours_per_student * num_students.&#xa;- Salary valid at a date = employee_salary row with the latest valid_from not after that date.&#xa;- A teacher may be allocated to at most business_rule &#39;max_course_instances_per_period&#39;&#xa;  course instances per study period and year (enforced by a trigger on allocation).&#xa;- department.manager_id is nullable because department and employee reference each other.&#xa;- All columns are NOT NULL unless otherwise stated." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="240" width="1240" x="40" y="1160" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
